<title>SWEDEN: Esselte on course for 10 pct profit rise.</title>
<headline>Esselte on course for 10 pct profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish office supply company Esselte AB said on Wednesday that a trend of increasing income in the second quarter of 1997 supported the group's goal to lift annual pre-tax income by 10 percent.</p>
<p>Esselte posted a four percent rise in pre-tax profit in the first half of 1997 to 308 million crowns with sales rising 10 percent to 6.27 billion crowns.</p>
</text>
